<title>FRANCE: French bonds settle higher after quiet session.</title>
<headline>French bonds settle higher after quiet session.</headline>
<text>
<p>1550 GMT - March bond future spent another day in narrow range with traders awaiting Greenspan, U.S. and German jobs data. Some spread trading between France/Bunds early on and rolling over from March to June PIBOR, but otherwise quiet.</p>
<p>*Mar 10-yr future 132.12, up 0.14. Vol 88,944. Open 132.22</p>
<p>*5.50 2007 OAT yield 5.44 pct vs 5.45. Bund spread -8 vs -10</p>
<p>*Call money unch at 3-1/8 1/4 pct. Jun PIBOR 96.64, up 2 bp</p>
</text>
